[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8703.07, "timestamp": "02:25:03", "text": "悲伤的一章。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8705.75, "timestamp": "02:25:05", "text": "也就是说，我差不多已经把损失处理完了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8708.27, "timestamp": "02:25:08", "text": "东西。哦。哦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8712.95, "timestamp": "02:25:12", "text": "哦，因为 JP 输了，就像，“不，没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8715.03, "timestamp": "02:25:15", "text": "就是这样，就是这样，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8722.15, "timestamp": "02:25:22", "text": "帽子。为什么人们不能自由地去做某事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8725.03, "timestamp": "02:25:25", "text": "不管他们怎么想，管他呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8725.95, "timestamp": "02:25:25", "text": "他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8730.63, "timestamp": "02:25:30", "text": "想？为什么这些人会说：“不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8733.07, "timestamp": "02:25:33", "text": "家庭。你不能那样做。你不能这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8748.51, "timestamp": "02:25:48", "text": "疼痛？没错。"}]